 foreach($k in @('processMemoryReads','processMemoryWrites','foregroundChanges','debuggerAttach','debuggerCommands','breakpointsInstalled','captures','gameInputs','automaticInputs','vmLifecycleChanges','serverChanges','protocolChanges','databaseChanges')){if([int]$r.operations.$k-ne0){Block 'FORBIDDEN_OPERATION_RECORDED'}}
 if($r.operations.permitIssued-ne$false){Block 'FORBIDDEN_OPERATION_RECORDED'}
}
if($RunId-notmatch'^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{7,63}$'){Block 'RUN_ID_INVALID'}
if(-not(Test-Path -LiteralPath $InteractiveCollectorPath)){Block 'INTERACTIVE_COLLECTOR_MISSING'}
$guestScript="C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-$RunId.ps1";$guestStarted="C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-$RunId-started.json";$guestRaw="C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-$RunId-receipt.json";$guestDiag="C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-$RunId-diagnostic.json"
$hostDir=Split-Path -Parent ([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($OutputPath));$hostStarted=Join-Path $hostDir "interactive-canary-$RunId-started.json";$hostRaw=Join-Path $hostDir "interactive-canary-$RunId-receipt.json";$hostDiag=Join-Path $hostDir "interactive-canary-$RunId-diagnostic.json"
$guestPaths=@($guestScript,$guestStarted,$guestRaw,$guestDiag);$hostPaths=@($hostStarted,$hostRaw,$hostDiag)

$bound=$false
if($null-ne$r-and$r.provenance-eq'LIVE_READONLY_CORRECTED_ROUTE_PREFLIGHT'){
 if([string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($BindingPath)-or-not(Test-Path -LiteralPath $BindingPath)){Block 'LIVE_BINDING_MISSING'}else{
  try{
   $b=Get-Content -LiteralPath $BindingPath -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json
   $keys=@('schemaVersion','runId','provenance','createdAtUtc','rawReceiptPath','rawReceiptSha256','preflightCollectorPath','preflightCollectorSha256','vmxPath','vmxSha256','programCopyReceiptPath','programCopyReceiptSha256','interactiveCollectorSourcePath','interactiveCollectorSourceSha256','interactiveCollectorSealedPath','interactiveCollectorSealedSha256','interactiveCollectorRoundTripPath','interactiveCollectorRoundTripSha256','preflightGuestScriptPath','programExecutable','argumentVector','interactivePaths','interactiveArgumentVector','historyLedgerPath','historyLedgerSha256','pathAbsenceReceiptPath','pathAbsenceReceiptSha256','guestSourceCopies','helperLaunchCalls','copyBackCalls','vmrunHostExitCode')
   if(-not(ExactKeys $b $keys)-or[int]$b.schemaVersion-ne1-or$b.provenance-cne'HOST_BOUND_CORRECTED_ROUTE_PREFLIGHT'){Block 'BINDING_SCHEMA_INVALID'}
   if([string]$b.runId-cne$RunId){Block 'BINDING_RUN_ID_MISMATCH'}
   if([IO.Path]::GetFullPath([string]$b.rawReceiptPath)-cne[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($ReceiptPath)-or$b.rawReceiptSha256-cne(Sha $ReceiptPath)){Block 'BINDING_RAW_HASH_MISMATCH'}
   if(-not(Test-Path $b.preflightCollectorPath)-or$b.preflightCollectorSha256-cne(Sha $b.preflightCollectorPath)){Block 'BINDING_COLLECTOR_HASH_MISMATCH'}
   if(-not(Test-Path $b.vmxPath)-or$b.vmxSha256-cne(Sha $b.vmxPath)){Block 'BINDING_VMX_HASH_MISMATCH'}
   try{$created=[datetime]$b.createdAtUtc}catch{$created=[datetime]::MinValue;Block 'BINDING_TIME_INVALID'}
   if($created-ne[datetime]::MinValue-and($created.ToUniversalTime()-lt$observed.ToUniversalTime()-or$created.ToUniversalTime()-gt$EvaluationTimeUtc.ToUniversalTime())){Block 'BINDING_TIME_INVALID'}
   if(-not(Test-Path $b.programCopyReceiptPath)-or$b.programCopyReceiptSha256-cne(Sha $b.programCopyReceiptPath)){Block 'BINDING_PROGRAM_COPY_RECEIPT_INVALID'}else{$programCopy=Get-Content $b.programCopyReceiptPath -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;try{$copyTime=[datetime]$programCopy.copiedAtUtc}catch{$copyTime=[datetime]::MinValue};if(-not(ExactKeys $programCopy @('schemaVersion','provenance','runId','guestProgramPath','hostCopyPath','hostCopySha256','hostCopyLength','copyExitCode','copiedAtUtc'))-or[int]$programCopy.schemaVersion-ne1-or$programCopy.provenance-cne'HOST_GUEST_PROGRAM_COPY_RECEIPT'-or$programCopy.runId-cne$RunId-or$programCopy.guestProgramPath-cne'C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe'-or[int]$programCopy.copyExitCode-ne0-or-not(Test-Path $programCopy.hostCopyPath)-or$programCopy.hostCopySha256-cne(Sha $programCopy.hostCopyPath)-or[int64]$programCopy.hostCopyLength-ne(Get-Item $programCopy.hostCopyPath).Length-or$programCopy.hostCopySha256-cne[string]$r.absoluteProgram.sha256-or[int64]$programCopy.hostCopyLength-ne[int64]$r.absoluteProgram.length-or$copyTime.ToUniversalTime()-lt$observed.ToUniversalTime()-or$copyTime.ToUniversalTime()-gt$created.ToUniversalTime()){Block 'BINDING_PROGRAM_COPY_RECEIPT_INVALID'}}
   $sourceHash=if(Test-Path $b.interactiveCollectorSourcePath){Sha $b.interactiveCollectorSourcePath}else{$null};$sealedHash=if(Test-Path $b.interactiveCollectorSealedPath){Sha $b.interactiveCollectorSealedPath}else{$null};$roundHash=if(Test-Path $b.interactiveCollectorRoundTripPath){Sha $b.interactiveCollectorRoundTripPath}else{$null}
   if([IO.Path]::GetFullPath([string]$b.interactiveCollectorSourcePath)-cne[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($InteractiveCollectorPath)-or$b.interactiveCollectorSourceSha256-cne$sourceHash-or$b.interactiveCollectorSealedSha256-cne$sealedHash-or$b.interactiveCollectorRoundTripSha256-cne$roundHash-or$sourceHash-cne$sealedHash-or$sourceHash-cne$roundHash){Block 'BINDING_INTERACTIVE_COLLECTOR_DRIFT'}
   $preArgs=@('-NoProfile','-ExecutionPolicy','Bypass','-File',[string]$b.preflightGuestScriptPath,'-RunId',$RunId,'-OutputPath','C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\corrected-route-preflight.json')
   $actual=@($b.argumentVector);$argBad=$actual.Count-ne$preArgs.Count-or(Compare-Object $preArgs $actual -SyncWindow 0).Count-ne0
   if($b.programExecutable-cne'C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe'-or$argBad-or[int]$b.guestSourceCopies-ne1-or[int]$b.helperLaunchCalls-ne1-or[int]$b.copyBackCalls-ne1-or[int]$b.vmrunHostExitCode-ne0){Block 'BINDING_ROUTE_INVALID'}
   $pathKeys=@('guestCollector','guestStarted','guestRaw','guestDiagnostic','hostStarted','hostRaw','hostDiagnostic')
   if(-not(ExactKeys $b.interactivePaths $pathKeys)-or$b.interactivePaths.guestCollector-cne$guestScript-or$b.interactivePaths.guestStarted-cne$guestStarted-or$b.interactivePaths.guestRaw-cne$guestRaw-or$b.interactivePaths.guestDiagnostic-cne$guestDiag-or[IO.Path]::GetFullPath([string]$b.interactivePaths.hostStarted)-cne[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($hostStarted)-or[IO.Path]::GetFullPath([string]$b.interactivePaths.hostRaw)-cne[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($hostRaw)-or[IO.Path]::GetFullPath([string]$b.interactivePaths.hostDiagnostic)-cne[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($hostDiag)){Block 'BINDING_INTERACTIVE_PATHS_INVALID'}
   $expectedInteractiveArgs=@('-NoProfile','-WindowStyle','Hidden','-ExecutionPolicy','Bypass','-File',$guestScript,'-RunId',$RunId,'-OutputPath',$guestRaw,'-StartedPath',$guestStarted,'-DiagnosticPath',$guestDiag);$actualInteractiveArgs=@($b.interactiveArgumentVector)
   if($actualInteractiveArgs.Count-ne$expectedInteractiveArgs.Count-or(Compare-Object $expectedInteractiveArgs $actualInteractiveArgs -SyncWindow 0).Count-ne0){Block 'BINDING_INTERACTIVE_ROUTE_INVALID'}
   if(-not(Test-Path $b.historyLedgerPath)-or$b.historyLedgerSha256-cne(Sha $b.historyLedgerPath)){Block 'BINDING_HISTORY_INVALID'}else{$history=Get-Content $b.historyLedgerPath -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;$historical=@($history.historicalRuns);$knownV1Paths=@('C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-20260829T183100Z-v1.ps1','C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-20260829T183100Z-v1-started.json','C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-20260829T183100Z-v1-receipt.json','C:\LOGH7_ORACLE\interactive-canary-20260829T183100Z-v1-diagnostic.json');if(-not(ExactKeys $history @('schemaVersion','provenance','historicalRuns'))-or[int]$history.schemaVersion-ne1-or$history.provenance-cne'IMMUTABLE_ATTEMPT_HISTORY'-or$historical.Count-ne1){Block 'BINDING_HISTORY_INVALID'}else{$past=$historical[0];$pastPaths=@($past.guestPaths);if(-not(ExactKeys $past @('runId','guestPaths'))-or[string]$past.runId-cne'20260829T183100Z-v1'-or$pastPaths.Count-ne$knownV1Paths.Count-or(Compare-Object $knownV1Paths $pastPaths -SyncWindow 0).Count-ne0){Block 'BINDING_HISTORY_INVALID'};if([string]$past.runId-ceq$RunId-or@($pastPaths|Where-Object{$guestPaths-contains$_}).Count-ne0){Block 'RUN_OR_PATH_REUSED'}}}
   if(-not(Test-Path $b.pathAbsenceReceiptPath)-or$b.pathAbsenceReceiptSha256-cne(Sha $b.pathAbsenceReceiptPath)){Block 'BINDING_PATH_ABSENCE_INVALID'}else{$absence=Get-Content $b.pathAbsenceReceiptPath -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;try{$absenceTime=[datetime]$absence.observedAtUtc}catch{$absenceTime=[datetime]::MinValue};$absenceGuest=@($absence.guestPaths);$absenceHost=@($absence.hostPaths);if(-not(ExactKeys $absence @('schemaVersion','provenance','runId','observedAtUtc','guestPaths','hostPaths','allAbsent'))-or[int]$absence.schemaVersion-ne1-or$absence.provenance-cne'HOST_PATH_ABSENCE_RECEIPT'-or$absence.runId-cne$RunId-or$absence.allAbsent-ne$true-or(Compare-Object $guestPaths $absenceGuest -SyncWindow 0).Count-ne0-or(Compare-Object $hostPaths $absenceHost -SyncWindow 0).Count-ne0-or$absenceTime.ToUniversalTime()-lt$observed.ToUniversalTime()-or$absenceTime.ToUniversalTime()-gt$created.ToUniversalTime()){Block 'BINDING_PATH_ABSENCE_INVALID'}}
   $bound=@($blockers|Where-Object{$_-match'^BINDING_|^LIVE_BINDING_'}).Count-eq0
  }catch{Block 'BINDING_INVALID'}
 }
}

$guestPaths=@($guestScript,$guestStarted,$guestRaw,$guestDiag);if(($guestPaths|Sort-Object -Unique).Count-ne4-or@($guestPaths|Where-Object{$_-match'\.\.'}).Count-ne0){Block 'ROUTE_PATHS_INVALID'}
$route=[ordered]@{runId=$RunId;programExecutable='C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe';programSha256=if($r){[string]$r.absoluteProgram.sha256}else{$null};programLength=if($r){[int64]$r.absoluteProgram.length}else{0};interactiveCollectorPath=[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($InteractiveCollectorPath);interactiveCollectorSha256=if(Test-Path $InteractiveCollectorPath){Sha $InteractiveCollectorPath}else{$null};guestCollectorPath=$guestScript;guestStartedPath=$guestStarted;guestRawReceiptPath=$guestRaw;guestDiagnosticPath=$guestDiag;hostStartedPath=$hostStarted;hostRawReceiptPath=$hostRaw;hostDiagnosticPath=$hostDiag;argumentVector=@('-NoProfile','-WindowStyle','Hidden','-ExecutionPolicy','Bypass','-File',$guestScript,'-RunId',$RunId,'-OutputPath',$guestRaw,'-StartedPath',$guestStarted,'-DiagnosticPath',$guestDiag);vmrunInteractive=$true;vmrunActiveWindow=$false;maxGuestSourceCopies=1;maxHelperLaunchCalls=1;maxCopyBackCalls=3;retryAllowed=$false}
$structural=@($blockers|Where-Object{$_-ne'EXECUTION_AUTHORITY_NOT_BOUND'}).Count-eq0;$prepared=$null-ne$r-and$r.provenance-eq'LIVE_READONLY_CORRECTED_ROUTE_PREFLIGHT'-and$bound-and$structural
if($prepared){Block 'EXECUTION_AUTHORITY_NOT_BOUND'}
$status=if($null-ne$r-and$r.provenance-eq'LIVE_READONLY_CORRECTED_ROUTE_PREFLIGHT'-and$blockers.Contains('LIVE_BINDING_MISSING')){'CLAIMED_LIVE_PREFLIGHT_UNBOUND'}elseif($prepared){'CORRECTED_ROUTE_LIVE_PREFLIGHT_STRUCTURALLY_READY_AUTHORITY_MISSING'}elseif($null-ne$r-and$r.provenance-eq'SYNTHETIC_FIXTURE'-and$blockers.Count-eq0){'STRUCTURALLY_READY_SYNTHETIC_PREFLIGHT_NOT_LIVE'}else{'CORRECTED_ROUTE_PREFLIGHT_REJECTED'}
$out=[ordered]@{schemaVersion=1;status=$status;routePreparedCandidateEligible=$prepared;routeLaunchCandidateEligible=$false;executionAuthorized=$false;prelaunchEligible=$false;independentReviewRequired=$true;route=$route;client=$client;debugger=$debugger;interactiveAgent=$agent;blockers=@($blockers)}
Write-CanonicalJson $out $OutputPath;$out|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 16
